## 👋 About Me

Aspiring Data Analyst with hands-on, end-to-end experience across the full data workflow — from cleaning messy raw data, to building relational databases and running statistical analysis, 
to designing interactive dashboards that communicate insights clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.


