| Category | Tools & Skills |
|---|---|
| **Databases & Querying** | SQL (PostgreSQL) — multi-table JOINs, aggregate functions, calculated fields, relational schema design |
| **Programming** | Python (pandas, scipy, matplotlib) — data cleaning, reshaping, statistical hypothesis testing |
| **Business Intelligence** | Power BI — DAX measures, data modeling, relationship design, interactive dashboards |
| **GIS & Spatial Analysis** | QGIS — spatial data analysis, environmental and risk mapping |
| **Spreadsheets** | Microsoft Excel |
| **Statistics** | Descriptive statistics, correlation analysis, hypothesis testing, data quality validation |
| **Core strengths** | Data cleaning & quality assurance · Analytical problem-solving · Attention to detail · Clear technical communication |

